+###############################################################################
+CF_HELP_MESSAGE(Options to Specify the Libraries Built/Used:)
+
+### Options to allow the user to specify the set of libraries which are used.
+### Use "--without-normal --with-shared" to allow the default model to be
+### shared, for example.
