+			  cloudabi*-eabi* \
+			| kfreebsd*-gnu* \
+			| knetbsd*-gnu* \
+			| kopensolaris*-gnu* \
+			| ironclad-* \
+			| linux-* \
+			| managarm-* \
+			| netbsd*-eabi* \
+			| netbsd*-gnu* \
+			| nto-qnx* \
+			| os2-emx* \
+			| rtmk-nova* \
+			| storm-chaos* \
+			| uclinux-gnu* \
+			| uclinux-uclibc* \
