+    <em>&lt;name&gt;@&lt;host.domain&gt;</em></p>
+  </blockquote>
+
+  <p>This list is open to anyone interested in helping with the
+  development and testing of this package.</p>
+
+  <p>Beta versions of <span class="main-name">ncurses</span> are
+  made available at</p>
+
+  <blockquote>
