+       --------------------------------------------
+       current_item           <STRONG><A HREF="mitem_current.3x.html">mitem_current(3x)</A></STRONG>
+       free_item              <STRONG><A HREF="mitem_new.3x.html">mitem_new(3x)</A></STRONG>
+       free_menu              <STRONG><A HREF="menu_new.3x.html">menu_new(3x)</A></STRONG>
