+</PRE><H2><a name="h2-NAME">NAME</a></H2><PRE>
+       <STRONG>item_name</STRONG>, <STRONG>item_description</STRONG> - get menu item name and description fields
+
+
+</PRE><H2><a name="h2-SYNOPSIS">SYNOPSIS</a></H2><PRE>
