+#%_
+set_pglen_inch			slength	str	YI	-		-	-----	Set page length to #1 hundredth of an inch (some implementations use sL for termcap).
+enter_horizontal_hl_mode	ehhlm	str	Q1	-		-	-----	Enter horizontal highlight mode
