+.\" $Id: curs_inopts.3x,v 1.116 2025/10/04 20:15:02 tom Exp $
+.TH curs_inopts 3X 2025-10-04 "ncurses @NCURSES_MAJOR@.@NCURSES_MINOR@" "Library calls"
