+\fB\%curs_ins_wstr\fP(3X) describes comparable functions of the
+.I \%ncurses
+library in its wide-character configuration
+.RI \%( ncursesw ).
+.PP
+\fB\%curses\fP(3X),
+\fB\%curs_inch\fP(3X),
+\fB\%curs_ins_wstr\fP(3X),
+\fB\%curs_util\fP(3X)
