+These functions return the count of characters copied from
+.I win
+to
+.I str
+(not including the null terminator),
+or
+.B ERR
+upon failure.
+.PP
+In
+.IR \%ncurses ","
+these functions fail if
+.bP
+the
+.I curses
+screen has not been initialized,
+.bP
+(for functions taking a
+.I \%WINDOW
+pointer argument)
