+Reading a line that overflows the array pointed to by
+.I wstr
+and its variants causes undefined results.
+Instead,
+use the
+.IR n -infixed
+functions with a positive
+.I n
+argument no larger than the size of the buffer backing
+.IR wstr "."
+.SH EXTENSIONS
+.BR \%innwstr ","
+.BR \%winnwstr ","
+.BR \%mvinnwstr ","
+and
+.BR \%mvwinnwstr "'s"
+acceptance of negative
+.I n
+values is an
