+.IR \%inwstr ","
+.IR \%winwstr ","
+.IR \%mvinwstr ","
+and
+.I \%mvwinwstr
+as returning
+.I OK
+rather than a (wide) character count,
+unlike their non-wide counterparts
+.IR \%instr ","
+.IR \%winstr ","
+.IR \%mvinstr ","
+and
+.IR \%mvwinstr "."
