+.\" $Id: curs_opaque.3x,v 1.50 2025/02/15 19:36:24 tom Exp $
+.TH curs_opaque 3X 2025-02-15 "ncurses @NCURSES_MAJOR@.@NCURSES_MINOR@" "Library calls"
+.ie \n(.g \{\
+.ds `` \(lq
+.ds '' \(rq
+.\}
