+..
+.
+.\" Emit hyperlink.  The optional argument supplies trailing punctuation
+.\" after link text.  `ME` and `UE` call this.
+.de mQ
+.  mY
+.  nh
+<\\*(mU>\\$1
+.  hy \\n(mH
+.  rm mU
+..
+.
