+.\" $Id: curs_trace.3x,v 1.55 2025/01/19 00:51:10 tom Exp $
+.TH curs_trace 3X 2025-01-18 "ncurses @NCURSES_MAJOR@.@NCURSES_MINOR@" "Library calls"
+.ie \n(.g \{\
+.ds `` \(lq
+.ds '' \(rq
+.\}
+.el \{\
+.ie t .ds `` ``
+.el   .ds `` ""
+.ie t .ds '' ''
+.el   .ds '' ""
+.\}
+.
+.de bP
+.ie n  .IP \(bu 4
+.el    .IP \(bu 2
+..
+.
+.de dS \" Start unfilled display.
+.nr aD \n(.j
+.na
+..
+.
+.de dE \" End unfilled display.
+.ad \n(.j
+.rr aD
