+.\" $Id: tset.1,v 1.94 2025/01/19 00:51:54 tom Exp $
+.TH @TSET@ 1 2025-01-18 "ncurses @NCURSES_MAJOR@.@NCURSES_MINOR@" "User commands"
+.ie \n(.g \{\
