+Priority: optional
+Maintainer: Thomas E. Dickey <dickey@invisible-island.net>
+Homepage: https://invisible-island.net/ncurses/
+Build-Depends: debhelper (>= 7),
+  gcc-mingw-w64-x86-64,
+  g++-mingw-w64-x86-64,
+  binutils-mingw-w64-x86-64
